@startuml
title US-006 - Choose plan before registering - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "ChoosePlanPage" as View
participant "PlanPicker" as Component
participant "authService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  authService already holds the US-001/US-003 registration calls; listPlans
  is proposed as one more method on it, not a new feature module.
end note

Admin -> View: Open the register-org link
activate View
View -> Service: listPlans()
activate Service
Service -> Http: GET /plans
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request
activate API
API --> Http: 200 OK (PlanDto[])
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response data
deactivate Http
Service --> View: PlanOption[]
deactivate Service
View -> Component: renderOptions(plans)
activate Component
Component --> View: Rendered, waiting for a pick
deactivate Component
View --> Admin: Show plan options
deactivate View

Admin -> View: Pick a plan and continue
activate View
View -> Component: handleContinue()
activate Component
Component --> View: Selected planId
deactivate Component
View --> Admin: Navigate to the organization/admin form (planId in the URL)
deactivate View
@enduml
